<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Oct 8.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Oct 8.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
